Es is a God. Born from Sym and Vaema, his power is to be able to change the nature of things. He could make an Invi and Aena and vice-versa, or he could make a bear a boulder, or a butterfly, honey. He could literally do anything like this.
As a child he had gotten into serious trouble for using his power carelessly.
Now that he had left home and he was much wiser, he was very careful with whom he changed.
Recently, a true dilemma had found him. He had started having visions from the future.
Only Physis could do something like that, the mother of all Gods.
And he had seen a war, a massive and bloodthirsty war that would be caused when the King Aena married the Queen Invi.
The problem was that the two didn't love each other, so they couldn't call upon the Universe's law that they would become Gods if they met somehow.
Yet, the Queen Invi had asked to become an Aena so she could unite their people.
Es knew, if he granted her that wish, war was inevitable. Or at least he thought he knew, cause of the visions he was having.
Instead, when the time came, he made the Queen Invi a star, the bightest one in the sky of the world, thinking that would solve all problems.
For a star is eternal and watches over all things. He thought the Queen could watch over all her people like this.
The Queen onyl said "You're wrong!" when he announced his decision but, helplessly, obliged.
Years passed, decades and then centuries and without a visible Queen to lead teh Invi the Aena King started getting greedy.
He started invading the Invi lands and spreading horror. Before long, the war Es had feared might happen if the two got married was happening anyway.
Without much he could do, he asked for help from his parents.
"Easy", his mother said. Change them all into the other and see how they like it.
"But do it carefully" his father added. "Timing is of the essence. Do it when it has the most impact in the story".
